# Build context of the deployment images (deploy/*.Dockerfile, MOD-17, ADR-072).
# Deny by default: only what an image needs is let back in, so a local .env,
# node_modules, dist, .git or the docs can never reach a layer.
*

# --- api image (deploy/api.Dockerfile)
!backend/package.json
!backend/package-lock.json
!backend/nest-cli.json
!backend/tsconfig.json
!backend/tsconfig.build.json
!backend/prisma.config.ts
!backend/prisma/
!backend/src/
!backend/scripts/

# Never, even inside the folders let in above.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
backend/src/generated/
backend/scripts/acceptance/
